INTERPRETATION KEY:
  - VA tracks/beats pt and stays <~1-2% across ka  -> Fix 5 low priority.
  - VA error grows systematically with ka, worse than/equal to pt, or
    n=2 vs n=3 doesn't converge                    -> radiation-gap signature.
  - |VAn2-pt|/|R_K| ~ e_pt (propagator effect drowned by shared error)
    -> propagator is not the bottleneck; Fix 5 won't help.
